<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">##<sp/>Features</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>High-performance<sp/>graphics<sp/>rendering<sp/>using<sp/>Vulkan</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>Modular<sp/>architecture<sp/>with<sp/>separate<sp/>components<sp/>for<sp/>IO<sp/>and<sp/>core<sp/>engine<sp/>functionality</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>Integration<sp/>with<sp/>GLFW<sp/>for<sp/>window<sp/>management<sp/>and<sp/>input<sp/>handling</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>Integration<sp/>with<sp/>GLM<sp/>for<sp/>mathematics<sp/>operations</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
